    <summaries>
      <summary>
        <versionCode>07</versionCode>
        <actionDate>2026-10-29</actionDate>
        <actionDesc>Reported to House</actionDesc>
        <updateDate>2026-11-12T21:26:08Z</updateDate>
        <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Common Sense 250 Act of 2026</strong></p><p>This bill requires the authorized monument honoring Thomas Paine to be located in Area 1 of the National Mall, which is reserved for commemorative works of preeminent historical and lasting significance to the United States. Thomas Paine was a philosopher and writer whose pamphlet, <em>Common Sense</em>, advocated&nbsp;for American independence from Great Britain.</p>]]></text>
      </summary>
    </summaries>
